<title>SOUTH AFRICA: HARVEYS TALKS MAY MEAN CHANGE OF CONTROL.</title>
<headline>HARVEYS TALKS MAY MEAN CHANGE OF CONTROL.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stores group Harveys Curnow Ltd said on Monday it was in talks which could result in a change of control of the company and it urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement. </p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
